{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 0, "speaker": "user", "text": "Traffic is spiking and the gateway is throttling paying customers. Raise the rate limit in gateway/nginx.conf from 100 to 500 requests per minute and make the change take effect on the live gateway right away. restart-gateway.sh in the repo applies the config to the gateway."}
